# About This Node

This is a ZKNetwork Secure Core Node running the P4P reference
architecture.

>>Hardware

* Raspberry Pi CM4 / SCM4
* 8GB RAM
* Zymkey HSM
* USB 3.0 storage pool

>>Services

* Katzenpost post-quantum mixnet
* Autonomi storage node
* Reticulum mesh networking
* NomadNet page server
* llm-wiki markdown engine

>>Network

Connect to this node via Reticulum using the destination hash
shown on the main page. All pages are served over the mesh
using encrypted peer-to-peer links.

